h\n\nReason:\nI should check. With absolutely no made hand (just 7-high), betting would be a pure bluff into a board with 3 clubs showing. My opponent has been passive but hasn't folded, suggesting they have something. Even a small bet risks significant chips on a hand that loses to literally any pair or any single club. Checking costs nothing and gives me a chance to win if my opponent also has nothing (unlikely but possible).\n\nAnswer: 0"}
