ive play throughout all streets. A small to medium value bet (around 200-300) can extract value from weaker Jacks or hesitant medium pairs while not risking too much if I'm beaten. Checking would be safe but misses value. The opponent's river check suggests weakness, so I should bet for value.\n\nAnswer: 250"}
